WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.387
Let’s make a private lookbook for Maya,

00:00:02.387 --> 00:00:05.095
a bride at our sample shop,
Juniper Bridal.

00:00:05.542 --> 00:00:06.997
Start in the gown catalog.

00:00:06.997 --> 00:00:08.763
Vale is already selected.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.248
Click Faye to add a second gown.

00:00:11.248 --> 00:00:13.816
Both styles now appear
in Maya’s shortlist.

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:17.470
Choose Build lookbook to set the rules
for her private link.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.107
Set the expiry to seven days.

00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:22.375
That gives Maya a week
to open her lookbook.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.753
Set the limit to two credits.

00:00:24.753 --> 00:00:27.633
This caps what her link can spend
on virtual try-ons.

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:30.663
In your shop workspace,
choose Send lookbook

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.923
to create the private link.

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:34.715
Copy that link into a message to Maya

00:00:34.715 --> 00:00:36.727
so she can open the gowns
you picked for her.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.357
Back in the demo,
choose Open bride’s view

00:00:39.357 --> 00:00:40.409
to see Maya’s side.

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.371
Select Faye to see the
one-shoulder gown on Maya.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.253
On a live link, Maya uploads
a full-length photo,

00:00:47.253 --> 00:00:50.511
enters her email, and gives permission
to generate her preview.

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:53.732
She chooses See it on you
to generate her preview.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.668
The demo supplies a sample photo.

00:00:56.668 --> 00:00:59.520
Choose See reference photo
to see what she started with.

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:03.286
Choose Show example try-on
to compare how the gown looks.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.580
If she wants to try it in person,

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.270
she chooses Request a fitting.

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.328
Back in Fitting requests,
your stylist can see

00:01:10.328 --> 00:01:12.508
Maya’s inquiry and email address.

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.688
Use that address to agree
on an appointment time

00:01:15.688 --> 00:01:16.884
and have her gown ready.

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.433
Try the same steps in the demo.

00:01:19.433 --> 00:01:21.984
You can reset it and start again
with a different gown.
